@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
allowmixing
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Notification configuration boundary

component "External properties" as Properties
component "Channel composition\n(startup)" as Composition
component "Installed channel registry" as Registry
component "Reader preference validation" as Preferences

class LendingServiceImpl
interface NotificationService
class SMSNotificationService
class EmailNotificationService
class WebhookNotificationService
interface ReaderRepository

Properties --> Composition : enabled channel identifiers
Composition --> Registry : validate / resolve

Registry --> SMSNotificationService : installed
Registry --> EmailNotificationService : installed
Registry --> WebhookNotificationService : installed

Composition ..> SMSNotificationService : instantiates if enabled
Composition ..> EmailNotificationService : instantiates if enabled
Composition ..> WebhookNotificationService : instantiates if enabled

Composition --> LendingServiceImpl : inject enabled instances\n(as NotificationService)
LendingServiceImpl --> NotificationService : notify on enabled channels\nchosen by the reader
LendingServiceImpl --> ReaderRepository : reads chosen channels

Composition --> Preferences : enabled channel set
Preferences --> ReaderRepository : stores chosen channels\n(rejects disabled ones)

SMSNotificationService ..|> NotificationService
EmailNotificationService ..|> NotificationService
WebhookNotificationService ..|> NotificationService
@enduml
